    <summary>A shared ChordPro songbook for bands</summary>
    <description>Songbook is a native Nextcloud app for a band's shared song library and setlists. This development version supports shared folder libraries, ChordPro import, indexed search and source viewing. Editing and setlists follow in later phases.</description>
